    "created_at": "2023-07-19T20:25:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-19T20:25:14Z",
    "body": "(I also agree that this is what the spec seems to currently say, but unfortunately not what browsers do. However, I'm in favor of trying to align browsers with the spec, if that's possible.)",
